From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:42:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bonito: port the power.stats HAL to AIDL

Patch 0016 dropped the HIDL power.stats HAL because
android.hardware.power.stats@1.0 is not in any compatibility matrix at
FCM level 7, which is what this device targets, so checkUnusedHals
rejected the manifest entry. The AIDL interface *is* in matrix 7, so the
same subsystem residency data can be served by porting the service.

hardware/google/pixel's powerstats/ is already back in the tree (it is
what libnos_citadeld_proxy needs), and it carries the AIDL PowerStats
implementation, the generic and wlan residency providers, the service rc
and the vintf fragment. All this needs is a main() naming the same rails
the HIDL service used.

The sysfs formats are unchanged, so the parser configs port across
verbatim: RPMh master_stats for APSS/MPSS/ADSP/CDSP, system_sleep/stats
for the AOSD and CXSD power domains, and wlan0/power_stats on a
debuggable build.

Citadel is not carried over. It was fed by the old vndbinder
power.stats-vendor service, which only the HIDL-era provider interface
speaks; the AIDL equivalent would need the citadeld blob to use the new
interface, which it does not.

No sepolicy change: hardware/google/pixel-sepolicy/powerstats already
labels the AIDL binary and the qcom rules already grant the three
sysfs/debugfs reads.

---
 device.mk              |   4 ++
 powerstats/Android.bp  |  23 +++++++++
 powerstats/service.cpp | 106 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 133 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 powerstats/Android.bp
 create mode 100644 powerstats/service.cpp

diff --git a/device.mk b/device.mk
index 61b50b97..ea2f9aad 100644
--- a/device.mk
+++ b/device.mk
@@ -215,6 +215,10 @@ PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
     frameworks/native/data/etc/android.hardware.strongbox_keystore.xml:$(TARGET_COPY_OUT_VENDOR)/etc/permissions/android.hardware.strongbox_keystore.xml \
     frameworks/native/data/etc/android.software.ipsec_tunnels.xml:$(TARGET_COPY_OUT_VENDOR)/etc/permissions/android.software.ipsec_tunnels.xml \
 
+# powerstats HAL
+PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
+    android.hardware.power.stats-service.pixel
+
 PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
     $(LOCAL_PATH)/powerhint.json:$(TARGET_COPY_OUT_VENDOR)/etc/powerhint.json
 
diff --git a/powerstats/Android.bp b/powerstats/Android.bp
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..b412ceae
